OL,3,AUK 'effectively blind' to early Covid
OL,4,Aspread due to lack of test and trace,
OL,5,Ainquiry finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FFailings in testing and tracing left
OL,8,Fthe UK effectively blind to how quickly
OL,9,FCovid was spreading early in the
OL,10,Fpandemic, the UK Covid Inquiry finds
OL,12,F"The UK was simply not prepared. Too
OL,13,Fmany lives were cut short," the
OL,14,Finquiry's chairwoman says
OL,16,FDespite British scientists developing a
OL,17,Fhighly accurate test for Covid in
OL,18,FJanuary 2020, the government was forced
OL,19,Fto abandon community testing in March
OL,20,F2020 at a critical moment, the inquiry
OL,21,Fsays
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
