OL,3,AUK 'effectively blind' to early Covid
OL,4,Aspread due to lack of test and trace,
OL,5,Ainquiry finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt also finds the UK lacked a clear
OL,8,Fstrategy for implementing border
OL,9,Fcontrol measures early in the pandemic,
OL,10,Fleaving the country in an "extremely
OL,11,Fvulnerable position"
OL,13,FThe lack of support to help people
OL,14,Fself-isolate is also criticised
OL,16,FThis is the seventh of 10 reports from
OL,17,Fthe UK Covid Inquiry - here is a recap
OL,18,Fof the previous reports
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
