OL,3,AMcDonald's sex abuse: 'They were
OL,4,Awaiting for the younger girls to turn
OL,5,A18'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA former McDonald's worker who says a
OL,8,Fmanager failed to protect her when she
OL,9,Fwas being sexualised by customers, has
OL,10,Fcalled on the firm to "change the way
OL,11,Fthey treat younger employees".
OL,13,FHope, who worked at a branch in the
OL,14,FWest Midlands in 2023, also told BBC
OL,15,FNews she saw older colleagues eyeing up
OL,16,F16- and 17-year-old workers, and
OL,17,Ftalking about wanting to sleep with
OL,18,Fthem when they turned 18.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1795092987
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMcDonald's sex abuse: 'They were
OL,4,Awaiting for the younger girls to turn
OL,5,A18'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHope is one of hundreds of workers
OL,8,Fbringing a discrimination claim against
OL,9,FMcDonald's. This week, a judge ruled
OL,10,Fagainst McDonald's attempt to have
OL,11,Ftheir claims struck out, a move that
OL,12,FHope welcomed.
OL,14,FMcDonald's said: "Ensuring a safe,
OL,15,Frespectful and inclusive working
OL,16,Fenvironment across our restaurants and
OL,17,Foffices remains a fundamental
OL,18,Fpriority."
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
