OL,3,AThis is a remarkable diplomatic moment
OL,4,Afor China's Xi - but it comes with
OL,5,Apitfalls
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnd surrounding it all is the
OL,8,Ffuturistic display that is Shenzhen,
OL,9,Fwith driverless cars cruising past as
OL,10,Fdrones fly overhead and robots -
OL,11,Fliterally - dance in the streets.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
